(text "Q804/Q805 THT BENCH ONLY: COMMON SOURCES, TWO OUTWARD DRAINS (TO-220 TABS ARE DRAIN, MUST REMAIN ISOLATED). R2101 47k G-S OFF passive; R2102 10k bounds ideal hard-sink current; D2101 12V nominal clamp NOT fail-safe. D2101 OPEN and VIN48 theoretical VGS>20V: unsafe. No independent comparator, driver, qualified SOA, VGS PVT or source. NEVER ENERGIZE. NO FAB / NO TX / NO BATTERIA / NO VEICOLO." (at 160 238.76 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "b827e001-0000-4000-8000-000000000047"))
